    "narrative": "The Austin Waves head into today\u2019s slate with **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** leading the charge at a commanding 80.22 efficiency score. Facing the lefty Liberatore, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** benefits from a substantial platoon advantage and a favorable batting order spot, making him our primary engine for run production. Meanwhile, **Cole Carrigg** offers the most intriguing upside on the roster today, netting a 71.23 score against Lugo. His switch-hitting ability combined with significant park factors and a strong SP matchup makes him a superior play to several starters, effectively justifying his high-leverage UTIL slot. **Gunnar Henderson** and **Kyle Tucker** also provide strong floors; while **Gunnar Henderson** must contend with the elite skill of Wheeler, his park-adjusted metrics and high-order position keep him squarely in the \"Strong\" category.\n\nThe toughest decision on today\u2019s bench involved **Luis Lara**, who fell just short of the 51.0 threshold with a 50.28 score. Despite his utility, the efficiency gains provided by the lower-order volatility of **Nasim Nunez**\u2014whose matchup against the vulnerable Ritchie provides a massive SP-skill boost\u2014pushed **Nasim Nunez** over the line. **Luis Lara** remains the primary pivot should any late-inning defensive replacements or weather delays shuffle the outfield. Conversely, we are steering clear of **Wade Meckler** and **Denzer Guzman** today; both are relegated to the bench with scores well below our 40.0 floor, largely due to the formidable presence of Misiorowski on the mound, whose elite xERA makes them high-risk liabilities for our game cap management. \n\nOwners should keep a close eye on **Liam Hicks** and **Drake Baldwin** behind the dish. While **Liam Hicks** sits at a 59.93 score thanks to an ideal matchup against Stock, any late lineup shifts could dampen his efficiency. We are also monitoring **Luis Robert Jr.**, whose 50.58 score is heavily penalized by his current platoon friction against Alcantara; while he is currently active, his status is the most precarious should we need to pinch-hit for contact later in the evening to protect our AVG category.",
